# Optional overrides for the RDS pipeline.
#
# Copy to rds/.env on this host (docker compose reads it for ${VAR}
# substitution):
#   cp rds/env.example rds/.env
#
# You do not set the dongle here: `./pipeline.sh up rds <serial>` exports
# RTL_TCP_PORT and RDS_DONGLE_ID for the chosen dongle, and those win over
# this file. Use a dongle with no FM notch (the V3 since 2026-09-26):
#   ./pipeline.sh up rds v3-01     # pauses that dongle's scanner
#   ./pipeline.sh down rds v3-01   # resumes it

# -- Station ---------------------------------------------
# FM carrier to decode, in Hz. BEST 92.6 decodes at the full group rate on the
# patio antenna (survey 2026-09-26); KISS 92.9 also works. 99.6, 95.2 and
# 105.5 carry little or no RDS there.
RDS_FREQ_HZ=92600000

# -- Tuner gain ------------------------------------------
# RTL gain in dB. The capture spans ~1.8 MHz of the FM band, so a loud
# neighbour counts too: on the patio antenna with no bandstop, 12.5 clips and
# 3.7 is clean. If block_errors climbs on the dashboard, try one step lower.
RDS_GAIN=3.7

# -- Pilot gate ------------------------------------------
# Median |pilot| below this => treat as no stereo pilot and emit nothing.
# 0.0 (off) decodes even a marginal station; raise it if a mono neighbour
# produces junk groups.
RDS_PILOT_THRESH=0.0

# -- ClickHouse ------------------------------------------
# Default is dev-only. Set a non-trivial value (env-only, not committed) before
# exposing the shared ClickHouse, matching the ais/ism secret pattern.
CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=rds_local
